---
---
<section class="sec_journey">
  <div class="padding-section-medium"></div>
  <div class="padding-global">
    <div class="container-large">
      <div class="journey_wrap">
        <div data-reveal class="journey_content">
          <div class="tag">
            <div class="dot-square"></div>
            <div>Our journey</div>
          </div>
          <div class="spacer-large"></div>
          <h2 class="scroll-right">Our journey toward  intelligent transformation</h2>
          <div class="spacer-large"></div>
          <div class="text-base text-color-secondary scroll-right">From our early days as a small consulting team to becoming a trusted AI partner for global organizations, our journey has been driven by curiosity, collaboration, and impact.</div>
        </div>
        <div data-reveal class="journey_data">
          <div class="journey_data_item">
            <div class="journey_data_year">
              <div class="text-xl text-color-on-primary">2017</div>
            </div>
            <div class="journey_data_content">
              <div class="text-base text-color-secondary">We started as a small consulting team focused on business strategy and process optimization.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="journey_data_item">
            <div class="journey_data_year">
              <div class="text-xl text-color-on-primary">2019</div>
            </div>
            <div class="journey_data_content">
              <div class="text-base text-color-secondary">As technology advanced, we expanded our expertise into digital strategy and data analytics.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="journey_data_item">
            <div class="journey_data_year">
              <div class="text-xl text-color-on-primary">2021</div>
            </div>
            <div class="journey_data_content">
              <div class="text-base text-color-secondary">Recognizing the growing potential of AI, we evolved our services to include automation, predictive analytics, and intelligent systems design.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="journey_data_item">
            <div class="journey_data_year">
              <div class="text-xl text-color-on-primary">2023</div>
            </div>
            <div class="journey_data_content">
              <div class="text-base text-color-secondary">We partnered with forward-thinking clients across industries  designing data-driven strategies and AI-powered frameworks.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="padding-section-medium"></div>
</section>
